    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nSetting `window.height` indeed has no effect because it is [not a support configuration setting](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb0f557a5797cfe9c720ed84a71582c22bccb4f8/doc/mini-map.txt#L214-L230). Map window indeed is forced to full available height mostly to simplify code and available configuration. [This is documented](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb0f557a5797cfe9c720ed84a71582c22bccb4f8/doc/mini-map.txt#L10). Having more flexible window configuration is also [documented as something that won't be done](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/eb0f557a5797cfe9c720ed84a71582c22bccb4f8/doc/mini-map.txt#L55-L57).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
